# Held back for a future release wave (Publishing/Visuals/Presentations) —
# fully built, deliberately excluded from the Security & Stability (0.8.4)
# package. vsce packages whatever's on disk regardless of git state, so this
# is needed even though these files are also gitignored. Remove when that
# wave is actually ready to ship. (test/yshow.test.js and
# test/visualZoomPanelController.test.js are already covered by test/** above.)
